    fix: "Never place raw request data into a header value. Strip CR/LF (value.replace(/[\\r\\n]/g, '')) or validate against a strict allowlist/enum, and for filenames use encodeURIComponent or a sanitized basename that is actually the value written. Prefer library helpers (e.g. res.attachment/res.download) that encode header values.",
